  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.found": "……等等。那是什么？",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.first.overworld": "一场风暴……矗立在地平线上，闪电在它体内游走。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.first.nether": "空气在颤动。就像盯着一座熔炉。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.first.end": "空间在它周围弯曲……像透过扭曲的玻璃看东西。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.first.deep_dark": "一点声音都没有。连我的心跳都显得太响了。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint.overworld": "霜冻、融化，然后突然开花……它脚下的大地从不保持原样。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint.nether": "它燃起……一股热浪滚过地面。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint.end": "空中的那些缝隙……从一道走进去，就会从另一道走出来。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint.deep_dark": "它在聆听。每一步、每一击……它都听得见。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint2.overworld": "地面发出蓝光的地方，下一道闪电就会落下。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint2.nether": "据说留在它中心的装备会被火焰淬炼。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint2.end": "箭矢在它下方悬停。连重力都忘了自己。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint2.deep_dark": "最好轻点走。潜行的话，它也许会放我过去。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.remember": "我不会忘记*这一场*。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hands": "我的手……",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.sky": "等等。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.quiet2": "*太*安静了。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hands2": "它们在*发麻*。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hands3": "我到底怎么了？",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.sky2": "天空……",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.sky3": "天空怎么了？",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.split2": "天空裂开了！",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.soon2": "不，不，不——",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.alive2": "我能*感觉*到它在呼吸。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.inside2": "……可里面是什么？",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.fade": "……它在消散。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.fade2": "那些光环……在松开。",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.fade3": "风暴会去哪里……",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.fade4": "……当它消逝的时候？",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.fade5": "下次再见。",
